flowchart TB
accTitle: Authentication ends in an enforced object-prefix boundary
accDescr: A user-pool sign-in produces identity-pool credentials, and IAM permits only objects under that identity ID while rejecting another identity prefix.
U["User pool: signed-in customer"] --> I["Identity pool: identity A"]
I --> R["Temporary authenticated-role credentials"]
R --> P{"Requested object matches private/A/?"}
P -->|Yes| A["Allow required object action"]
P -->|No, private/B/| D["Deny absent another grant"]
class U inputData
class I,R,P decision
class A output
class D warning
